            "value": "North America"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "北斗七星の柄の先まで一晩中沈まないのは、北緯 41° より北。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If the whole Big Dipper stays above the horizon, you are north of 41°N."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "北極星の高さ %d° → 北緯 約 %d°。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Polaris stood %d° high → about %d°N."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "北極星の高さは緯度": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Polaris height = latitude"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "北極星の高さは緯度。南十字が見えたら南の国。南北の線にある星座で月が分かる。時計の差は経度。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Polaris's height is your latitude. The Southern Cross means south. What sits on the meridian gives the month. The clock gap gives longitude."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "北極星は天の北極のすぐそば。地平線からの高さが、そのまま北緯になる。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Polaris sits by the north celestial pole. Its height above the horizon is your latitude."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "北緯": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "N"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "北緯 %d° なので、北斗七星は一晩中沈まない。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "At %d°N the Big Dipper never sets."
          }
        }
      }
    },
