    "南十字で天の南極": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cross points to the pole"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "南十字の長い腕を 4.5 倍のばした所が天の南極。その高さが南緯。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Extend the Cross's long arm 4.5 times to find the south pole. Its height is your southern latitude."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "南十字は北緯 27° より北ではほとんど見えない。見えたら南の国。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Southern Cross hides north of about 27°N. Seeing it means you are far south."
          }
        }
      }
    },
